1055
00:43:18.300 --> 00:43:18.920
That's right.

1056
00:43:19.120 --> 00:43:19.440
Mm-hmm.

1057
00:43:19.720 --> 00:43:20.160
Yes.

1058
00:43:20.420 --> 00:43:23.900
