My favorite thing is when you see Andy fuming in the back of Dwight's talking head.

1062
00:43:34.700 --> 00:43:34.840
Through the window.

1063
00:43:34.840 --> 00:43:36.840
When he's bobbing his chair back and forth.

1064
00:43:37.060 --> 00:43:37.780
So good.

1065
00:43:37.920 --> 00:43:38.440
So good.

1066
