1068
00:43:46.240 --> 00:43:46.380
Yeah.

1069
00:43:46.560 --> 00:43:48.940
Well, this was sort of a last-minute pitch from Dave.

1070
00:43:48.940 --> 00:43:51.440
He really wanted to pump up the Cornell merch.

1071
00:43:51.620 --> 00:43:51.840
Okay.

1072
00:43:51.840 --> 00:43:54.260
So he was like, what if he's holding something?

1073
00:43:54.500 --> 00:43:57.420
They made that mug in two hours.

1074
00:43:57.540 --> 00:43:57.940
What?

1075
00:43:58.160 --> 00:43:59.080
Our props department.

1076
00:43:59.420 --> 00:44:00.420
Oh, my gosh.

1077
00:44:00.580 --> 00:44:00.740
Yeah.

1078
00:44:00.900 --> 00:44:03.160
So that he could have it in this talking head.

1079
00:44:03.420 --> 00:44:08.440
You know, I've seen that happen on set sometimes where there'll be an actor and they're supposed

1080
00:44:08.440 --> 00:44:09.820
