1123
00:45:47.040 --> 00:45:48.320
Like, I died, dad.

1124
00:45:48.480 --> 00:45:49.100
I'm going to get him.

1125
00:45:49.220 --> 00:45:50.460
Like, he's like so mad.

1126
00:45:51.340 --> 00:45:56.480
One of my favorite scenes is the one with Dwight at his desk where he's got all this

1127
00:45:56.480 --> 00:45:56.700
merch.

