00:46:06.820 --> 00:46:07.300
Yeah.

1131
00:46:07.620 --> 00:46:09.520
And Andy loses it.

1132
00:46:09.660 --> 00:46:10.980
He's like, that's big red bear.

1133
00:46:11.700 --> 00:46:16.680
Well, I asked Phil Shea if that was a real Cornell bobblehead or if we had to make it.

1134
