And he said it was real.

1135
00:46:19.240 --> 00:46:24.560
Throughout all these years of the show, because Andy had gone to school at Cornell, he made

1136
00:46:24.560 --> 00:46:29.280
contacts at the school, particularly the Cornell bookstore.

1137
00:46:29.800 --> 00:46:32.440
And that is where he got the bobblehead.

1138
00:46:32.440 --> 00:46:38.120
He said, Claudia, Sandra, Peggy, and Patricia are the ladies at Cornell that would always

1139
00:46:38.120 --> 00:46:42.500
help him out whenever we had a storyline that required some Cornell merch.

1140
00:46:42.840 --> 00:46:46.880
There's going to be a really good one coming up, and I can't wait to share it in a future

1141
00:46:46.880 --> 00:46:47.360
episode.

1142
00:46:47.580 --> 00:46:48.620
Thank you, ladies.

1143
00:46:48.700 --> 00:46:50.580
I love that Phil had all his people.

1144
00:46:50.720 --> 00:46:51.920
He had all his people everywhere.

1145
00:46:52.300 --> 00:46:55.580
Well, I have a little thing to share about that Cornell bobblehead as well.

1146
00:46:56.000 --> 00:46:57.740
So it was not the first choice.

1147
00:46:57.940 --> 00:46:59.260
