1148
00:47:02.440 --> 00:47:05.720
Have his cell phone ringtone be the Cornell fight song.

1149
00:47:05.920 --> 00:47:07.080
Ooh, that's a good idea.

1150
00:47:07.260 --> 00:47:07.480
Yeah.

1151
00:47:07.640 --> 00:47:10.700
But then when they heard it, it just didn't quite work in the moment.

1152
00:47:10.880 --> 00:47:11.980
It was just like too much setup.

1153
00:47:12.280 --> 00:47:17.780
And so they felt like the bobblehead was just like this quick, like, boom, I now have the

1154
00:47:17.780 --> 00:47:19.440
Cornell merch on my desk.

1155
00:47:19.820 --> 00:47:25.460
Well, I like the personal connection to Angela and the bobbleheads as well.

1156
00:47:25.620 --> 00:47:26.460
Side by side.

1157
00:47:26.600 --> 00:47:26.980
Yes.

1158
00:47:27.420 --> 00:47:30.060
So I like that choice for that reason.

1159
00:47:30.060 --> 00:47:35.080
Well, it almost was Give My Regards to Davey, which is the Cornell fight song playing on

1160
00:47:35.080 --> 00:47:35.820
Dwight's cell phone.

1161
00:47:36.640 --> 00:47:41.000
You know the scene where Andy confronts Dwight outside of the bathroom?

