1239
00:51:20.940 --> 00:51:22.700
That was the last day of shooting.

1240
00:51:22.920 --> 00:51:23.260
Oh, wow.

1241
00:51:23.560 --> 00:51:23.880
Yeah.

1242
00:51:24.060 --> 00:51:27.900
He said we needed time to get all those costumes and everything organized.

1243
00:51:28.300 --> 00:51:28.500
Yeah.

