00:51:48.380 --> 00:51:49.280
You know I do.

1255
00:51:49.760 --> 00:51:57.200
Pete Halpert was played by Tug Coker, and Tom Halpert was played by Blake Robbins.

1256
00:51:57.420 --> 00:51:58.600
They were super tall.

1257
00:51:59.020 --> 00:51:59.980
Very tall.

1258
00:52:00.360 --> 00:52:01.940
There's the reason for that.

1259
00:52:02.360 --> 00:52:06.880
John Krasinski has two very tall brothers in real life,

1260
00:52:06.920 --> 00:52:10.160
